From ab47378f657b8d13d72077009107d223ba04d3a3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: vince <vincepaul.liem@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 23:23:37 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat(launch): join owned directory and image cwd operations

Translate public directory descriptors through their VFS owner for
enumeration, relative paths, rename and removal. Resolve image-relative
paths and exec against the calling process cwd, preserving native fork
semantics and the existing configured namespace boundary.

Signed-off-by: vince <vincepaul.liem@gmail.com>
